4:  * Every oracle text below is copied verbatim from the imported Scryfall
5:  * database, not written from memory. That matters more than it sounds:
6:  * Scryfall has switched much of its self-referential wording from the card's
7:  * name to "this creature" / "this land", so text recalled from older printings
8:  * exercises patterns that no longer occur. Re-copy from the database rather
